WEBVTT

00:12:28.994 --> 00:12:31.079
Except that's not true either.

00:12:31.538 --> 00:12:36.084
Actually, the city where Hernan Cortéz
found his military allies,

00:12:36.084 --> 00:12:38.921
the ones who enabled
his successful assault

00:12:38.962 --> 00:12:42.466
on the Aztec capital of Tenochtitlán,

00:12:42.466 --> 00:12:46.887
was exactly one such city without rulers:

00:12:47.471 --> 00:12:51.809
an indigenous republic
by the name of Tlaxcala,

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:54.019
governed by an urban parliament,

00:12:54.061 --> 00:12:57.147
which had some pretty interesting
initiation rituals

00:12:57.189 --> 00:12:58.774
for would-be politicians.

00:12:58.816 --> 00:13:00.776
They'd be periodically whipped